# Input graph for the `tache_path` parameter of `visualisation` (see driver.py).
# Holds 2 instance(s) of :Tache, the class the region's query on g_tache selects,
# and a neighbourhood that this query must not match: instances of the five
# other tracked classes (so a query wired to the wrong graph, or a file parsed
# into the wrong graph, changes the result), the class reached by another
# predicate than rdf:type, and a same-named class in another namespace.
@prefix : <http://dig.isi.edu/> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

:tache_1 a :Tache .
:tache_2 a :Tache .

:activite_in_tache a :Activite .
:historique_in_tache a :Generation .
:phenomene_in_tache a :Phenomene_Metier .
:domaine_in_tache a :Domaine .
:strategie_in_tache a :Strategie .
:tache_seeAlso rdfs:seeAlso :Tache .
<http://other.example/tache_9> a <http://other.example/Tache> .
